   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Numerals with people",
     "texto": [
      "In the masculine personal plural, the nominative allows **trzej eksperci** («three experts»).",
      "With five or more, the numeral in **-u** is used with the plural genitive: **pięciu badaczy przyszło** («five researchers came», neuter singular verb)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Numerals in other cases",
     "texto": [
      "Numerals also decline: **w dwóch grupach** («in two groups»), **z trzema ekspertami** («with three experts»).",
      "Don't always translate «two, three, five» with a fixed Polish form."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
